note SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
note Traced entry points for native/blackwell/launch.om. Compose after context.om (or a host
note stand-in), vector.om, launch.om and native/trace/htrec.om. launch.om itself is not changed, so a
note unit that does not include this file and htrec.om is byte-identical to before.
note
note htopen and htlaunch behave exactly like gbopen and gblaunch and return the same result. While
note recording is off they make one flag test and call through. While it is on they record:
note   gpu.open span        launch.om:gbopen     a0 bytes allocated, a1 code bytes uploaded, status nverr
note   mem.alloc instants   launch.om:gbmem      a0 bytes, a1 buffer slot 0..7, status the handle sign
note   kernel.launch span   VECTOR_1D            a0 elements n, a1 last stage reached, status nverr
note   mem.moved instant    launch.om:gbcmd      a0 command bytes written to buffer 0, a1 direction 1
note The launch span covers command build, upload, submission, the host wait for the completion
note mark and the readback checks; launch.om has no hook between them, so the span records the last
note stage reached (nvstage 40 build/upload, 41 submit, 42 host wait, 43 completion checks).
note Name ids 101..106 are reserved for this file.
text htlnames "launch.om:gbopen|kernel:VECTOR_1D/vector.om:gbvec|launch.om:gbmem|launch.om:gbcmd|launch.om:gbcode|host.readback"
fn htlname to bool
id = uint 101
ok = htnbeg id
for i ulong len htlnames
b = get htlnames i
if eq b 124
ok = and ok htnend
id = add id 1
ok = and ok htnbeg id
else
ok = and ok htnbyte b
end
end
ret and ok htnend
end
note htgbsz: the size launch.om gbopen requests for buffer i (launch.om lines 240-246). The host test
note checks it against the sizes the stand-in nvalloc actually received.
fn htgbsz i ulong n uint to ulong
if ge i 5
ret mul ulong n 4
end
if or eq i 0 eq i 2
ret 65536
end
ret 4096
end
fn htopen n uint to bool
if not htlive
ret gbopen n
end
s = htbeg 3 101
ok = gbopen n
total = ulong 0
for i ulong 8
m = get gbmem i
if and ok gt m 0
sz = htgbsz i n
total = add total sz
b = htmark 5 103 sz i 0
end
end
code = ulong 0
rc = long 0
if ok
code = get gblen 0
b = htmark 11 105 code 1 0
else
rc = get nverr 0
end
b = htend s total code rc
ret ok
end
fn htlaunch n uint to bool
if not htlive
ret gblaunch n
end
note gblaunch writes nvstage 40 before any work; it is cleared here only to see whether that
note happened, and restored when gblaunch refused its arguments first, so state matches gblaunch.
prev = get nvstage 0
put nvstage 0 0
s = htbeg 4 102
ok = gblaunch n
st = ulong get nvstage 0
if eq st 0
put nvstage 0 prev
end
if ge st 41
b = htmark 11 104 get gbused 0 1 0
end
rc = long 0
if not ok
rc = get nverr 0
end
b = htend s ulong n st rc
ret ok
end
